---
import "../../src/styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Melagram</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn more about Melagram — a place to connect, network, create, and build community."
    />
  </head>

  <body class="min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden">
    <!-- TOP GOLD LINE -->
    <div class="gold-line w-full"></div>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <header class="border-b border-white/10 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 lg:px-10">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img
            src="/images/melagram-logo.jpg"
            alt="Melagram"
            class="h-12 w-auto object-contain"
          />
        </a>

        <nav class="hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm tracking-wide md:flex">
          <a href="/" class="nav-link text-white/75">Home</a>
          <a href="/discover" class="nav-link text-white/75">Discover</a>
          <a href="/communities" class="nav-link text-white/75">Communities</a>
          <a href="/creators" class="nav-link text-white/75">Creators</a>
          <a href="/about" class="gold-text nav-link">About</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="/login"
            class="hidden rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white/80 transition hover:border-[#d9ad55] hover:text-white sm:inline-flex"
          >
            Log In
          </a>

          <a
            href="/join"
            class="cta rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white"
          >
            Join Melagram
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <main>
      <section class="relative px-6 pb-20 pt-24 lg:px-10 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-32">
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 -z-10"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(109,25,201,.25), transparent 40%);"
        ></div>

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center">
          <p class="gold-text mb-5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.35em]">
            ABOUT MELAGRAM
          </p>

          <h1
            class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
          >
            CONNECTION
            <span class="gold-text">MEETS</span>
            COMMUNITY.
          </h1>

          <div class="gold-line mx-auto mt-8 w-40"></div>

          <p
            class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/65 sm:text-lg"
          >
            Melagram is a place where people connect, communities grow,
            creativity comes to life, and meaningful relationships have room
            to develop.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- OUR STORY -->
      <section class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <p class="gold-text text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em]">
              OUR STORY
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
              Built for <span class="gold-text">connection.</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="gold-line mt-6 w-28"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-white/65">
            <p>
              Melagram was created around a simple idea: people deserve a
              place to connect with one another, discover new communities,
              share their creativity, and build relationships beyond the
              limits of a single feed.
            </p>

            <p>
              Social networking should be more than scrolling. It should give
              people opportunities to participate, create, discover, and
              belong.
            </p>

            <p>
              That's the experience Melagram is being built to provide.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- WHAT MELAGRAM IS -->
      <section class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
        <div class="luxury-panel gold-border mx-auto max-w-6xl p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16">
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="gold-text text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em]">
              THE PLATFORM
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
              What is <span class="gold-text">Melagram?</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-8 text-white/60">
              A growing social platform designed around people, communities,
              creators, and discovery.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            <div class="feature-card gold-border rounded-2xl bg-black/30 p-6">
              <div class="mb-5 text-3xl">♛</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl text-white">Connect</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/55">
                Find people with shared interests, passions, and perspectives.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card gold-border rounded-2xl bg-black/30 p-6">
              <div class="mb-5 text-3xl">♜</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl text-white">Communities</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/55">
                Discover spaces where conversations and relationships can grow.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card gold-border rounded-2xl bg-black/30 p-6">
              <div class="mb-5 text-3xl">✦</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl text-white">Create</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/55">
                Share ideas, creativity, stories, conversations, and more.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card gold-border rounded-2xl bg-black/30 p-6">
              <div class="mb-5 text-3xl">♕</div>
              <h3 class="text-xl text-white">Discover</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/55">
                Explore people, creators, communities, and new possibilities.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- VISION -->
      <section class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
          <p class="gold-text text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em]">
            OUR VISION
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            A place where
            <span class="gold-text">you belong.</span>
          </h2>

          <div class="gold-line mx-auto mt-8 w-32"></div>

          <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-9 text-white/60">
            We envision a social experience where people aren't simply
            audiences. They're participants. They're creators. They're
            community builders. They're the reason the platform exists.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- THE DIFFERENCE -->
      <section class="px-6 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
          <div class="mb-12">
            <p class="gold-text text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em]">
              THE MELAGRAM DIFFERENCE
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
              More than a <span class="gold-text">timeline.</span>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="luxury-panel gold-border rounded-2xl p-8">
              <h3 class="text-2xl text-white">People First</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-white/60">
                Melagram is being designed around the people who make a
                community worth joining.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="luxury-panel gold-border rounded-2xl p-8">
              <h3 class="text-2xl text-white">Community Driven</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-white/60">
                Communities give people somewhere to gather, talk, share, and
                build something together.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="luxury-panel gold-border rounded-2xl p-8">
              <h3 class="text-2xl text-white">Creator Friendly</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-white/60">
                Creators deserve spaces where their work can be discovered
                and appreciated.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="luxury-panel gold-border rounded-2xl p-8">
              <h3 class="text-2xl text-white">Built to Grow</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-white/60">
                Melagram is being built one piece at a time, with room for
                new ideas, new communities, and new possibilities.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
        <div
          class="arch mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-12 pt-16 text-center sm:px-12 sm:pb-16 sm:pt-20"
        >
          <p class="gold-text text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.35em]">
            YOUR STORY STARTS HERE
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            Ready to join <span class="gold-text">Melagram?</span>
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl leading-8 text-white/60">
            Connect with people. Find your communities. Share your creativity.
            Build something meaningful.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
            <a
              href="/join"
              class="cta rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white"
            >
              Create Your Account
            </a>

            <a
              href="/discover"
              class="rounded-full border border-[#d9ad55]/50 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm text-white/80 transition hover:border-[#d9ad55] hover:text-white"
            >
              Explore Melagram
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-10 lg:px-10">
      <div
        class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-5 text-center sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:text-left"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="gold-text font-semibold tracking-[0.2em]">MELAGRAM</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-white/40">
            Connect. Network. Create. Build Community.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-white/45 sm:justify-end">
          <a href="/about" class="hover:text-white">About</a>
          <a href="/discover" class="hover:text-white">Discover</a>
          <a href="/communities" class="hover:text-white">Communities</a>
          <a href="/creators" class="hover:text-white">Creators</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>